    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The cleanup query used to delete only reminders where method == SMS and scheduledDate <= now, but after the change it deletes any row that satisfies OR [SMS+overdue, retryCount > 1]. Because retryCount is incremented on send failures, this new OR branch can remove reminders of other methods and even future-dated SMS reminders once they have retried more than once, escaping the method and scheduledDate guards that previously constrained the delete.",
